贿犯罪嫌疑人刘贤志在境外落网并被遣返回国。\n\n刘贤志，男，1977年2月生，北京志骏腾达建筑工程有限公司实际控制人，涉嫌向多名公职人员行贿，于2026年5月外逃。陕西省监察机关依法对刘立案调查，扎实开展追逃追赃工作，积极开展国际执法合作，于近日将其缉拿归案。\n\n中央追逃办负责人表示，刘贤志归案是纪检监察机关贯彻党的二十届五中全会精神，落实反跨境腐败法，深入开展追逃追赃工作的最新成果。我们将持续深化反腐败执法司法合作，有效预防和惩治跨境腐败行为，坚持受贿行贿一起查、一起追，坚决追回外逃涉腐人员和境外涉腐资产，决不让境外成为法外。","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/YNV3511a0IMJ62yd79eOLjnLRPqavaB2moM7yAn2xnKutfVv-3_h3wXAl29kdSMswUYFsSVZpeH6TJ6-hl4txi0556tvaqiIdRh9CF67H4nzU-F3k2vhWOlPKeFwph0m5FRmszIwlUd8wRN39nMod1s505lM0EYTKz9Mt5fMk0Q-N9ErrdyutqivBMltONNN-HvjsQ2lFkFSDCbQn_Daow0lUPinWkK8NeIWWhMia98XdrVuna_xT2l1UvE6FNCKh3ZYo_OKsLEX4OHuzHP5nhzhCjPhsqHbAWnVkSEtkj6izouY9MV_8CfQ9iYJ6HsN2-JMHfTSoau9KgC0-fHaVw.jpg"}],"views":1250,"views_label":"1.25K","reactions":[{"emoji":"👏","count":6,"label":"6"},{"emoji":"🥱","count":1,"label":"1"},{"emoji":"🖕","count":1,"label":"1"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:06:32+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113512","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"特朗普又开始回味在中国受到热情欢迎","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113512","image":{"url":"media/freechinese/113512_1.webp","width":800,"height":639},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:19:31+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:09:09+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"特朗普又开始回味在中国受到热情欢迎","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/hujuAJLYD8geHuhOpJTDFeNNUez2ySFxlqKEQtX4urnez1kRaujLT-JutSAYqin3cwRhrvfnhxGs46-nD5InxEtSs__mimYqdMzqh-laU-qM_y9cJw0Mv7AuH4qOy6-7hSpiuswa_aPFMxG-aUDDUaj_cyCp8Eu6CFYOUwsdhpXKjdQzS87EsEpeqyaeEDuEAS_xLG0Su3jnGd18I2R5hvjfRNsv5F4T_OJXR9IUg9LDYyAHG6z7dVExGgt-oC1_mGp9hpoIvg_OJ2BWV9jMcNOWlxUfoHNE0vq7_OPu95gSs84Xgk4yaZ2__E6O_Jwf3df2UJxbCMn8n_eaKQiqXw.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Z264Gq-BR-XEUkt3TZPGa7vWIQuLGbaAm163kll8NwqNrdgPB5TWDunlov48FW2AWeyZa6_CcPDyhi2h7IR0IjqrnsgjG2Z_NXiaN_bQHEeXY1V5070HvlfYRoOS3EmRw8NyKR2VGEuVviTL9kGepqOmRGTQ4v8pDStbNC3LaISJ0vVe2hXXZm9a4ujAm1ZaGVdAoYlMqm_BUlOm0pFUC3ldvLkQh9m13vTBCCTHmU